COMMENT	QUP/START WILL SETUP WORLD FROM SCRATCH

PUSH
DIR :UDD:PIPER:QUEST
STRING 300
[!NEQ,%1%,]
   STRING %1%
[!END]
[!EQUAL,([!FILENAME,QUEST]),()]
  DELETE/2=IGNORE QUEST.OUT
  DEFACL + OWARE
  CRE/1=IGNORE/2=IGNORE QUEST.OUT
  PROC/DEF/OUT=QUEST.OUT/PRIORITY=[!STR]/NAME=Q_SERVE QUEST_SERVER%0/%
[!END]
POP
